{"t":"XEL","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Xcel Energy Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":11534,"hq":"Minneapolis, MN, United States","website":"https://my.xcelenergy.com","summary_en":"Xcel Energy Inc., through its subsidiaries, operates as an electric and natural gas delivery company in the United States. It operates through Regulated Electric Utility and Regulated Natural Gas Utility segments. The company generates, purchases, transmits, distributes, and sells electricity through its energy portfolio, including wind, nuclear, hydroelectric, biomass, and solar power from both owned generation facilities and PPAs, as well as its fossil fuel energy portfolio, such as coal and natural gas; sale and resale of wholesale transmission service; and engages in wholesale commodity and trading operations. It also purchases, transports, stores, distributes, and sells natural gas; develops and leases natural gas pipelines and storage facilities; operates interstate natural gas pipeline; and invests in rental housing projects, energy technology companies, and community solar garden nonregulated assets. It serves electric and natural gas customers in portions of Colorado, Michigan, Minnesota, New Mexico, North Dakota, South Dakota, Texas, and Wisconsin. The company was formerly known as Northern States Power company. Xcel Energy Inc. was incorporated in 1909 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Xcel Energy Inc.는 자회사를 통해 미국에서 전기 및 천연가스 운송 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 이는 규제된 전기 유틸리티 및 규제된 천연가스 유틸리티 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 자체 발전 시설과 PPA를 통한 풍력, 원자력, 수력 전기, 바이오매스, 태양열 발전을 포함한 에너지 포트폴리오와 석탄, 천연 가스 등 화석 연료 에너지 포트폴리오를 통해 전기를 생성, 구매, 전송, 분배 및 판매합니다. 도매 전송 서비스 판매 및 재판매; 상품 도매 및 무역 업무에 종사하고 있습니다. 또한 천연가스를 구매, 운송, 저장, 유통 및 판매합니다. 천연가스 파이프라인과 저장 시설을 개발 및 임대합니다. 주간 천연가스 파이프라인을 운영합니다. 임대 주택 프로젝트, 에너지 기술 회사, 지역사회 태양열 정원 비규제 자산에 투자합니다. 콜로라도, 미시간, 미네소타, 뉴멕시코, 노스다코타, 사우스다코타, 텍사스, 위스콘신 일부 지역의 전기 및 천연가스 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Northern States Power 회사로 알려졌습니다. Xcel Energy Inc.는 1909년에 설립되었으며 미네소타 주 미니애폴리스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":81.58,"mcap":52364115968.0,"pe":19.016317,"fpe":17.856634,"peg":1.7493,"ps":3.52075,"pb":2.0317793,"ev_ebitda":14.571,"div":2.92,"beta":0.345,"hi52":84.23,"lo52":68.72},"fin":{"rev":14872999936.0,"rev_g":0.066,"eps_g":0.727,"gross":0.47274,"op":0.21656999,"net":0.17944999,"roe":0.114350006,"fcf":-8347624960.0,"cash":2500000000.0,"debt":42752999424.0,"de":167.652,"eps":4.29,"feps":4.56861},"own":{"short":0.0809,"inst":0.96322995,"insider":0.00174},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":89.81579,"median":92.0,"high":99.0,"low":76.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.45,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":14,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":14,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":13,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":13,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":94.0,"priorPriceTarget":85.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":89.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":85.0,"priorPriceTarget":83.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":86.0,"priorPriceTarget":91.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":85.0,"priorPriceTarget":90.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","F